          "caption": "To a Traveler\nStop, passenger! You came without knowing\nThis land is where an era sank.\nBend down and listen, this silent mass\nA homeland is where the heart beats.\nAt the end of this desolate, shadowless road\nThis hill you see is in Anatolia,\nFor the sake of independence, on the way of honor\nIt is the place where Mehmed, who gave his life, lays.\n\nNecmettin Halil Onan",
